  "approvalRecord": "User approved a Mobile-Web/PWA-only implementation, Folo Mobile parity outside Home, all Folo login methods, and a Go-server-owned Gemini secret configuration; the Codex Goal must continue through coding, tests, and mobile acceptance.",
