  "lockedDecisions": [
    "The only product client is deployable Mobile Web/PWA; PC-specific UI, Electron runtime, and native apps are excluded.",
    "Folo Mobile supplies the non-Home information architecture and interaction baseline; Home alone is replaced by the approved prototype flow.",
    "Tantan exposes Google, GitHub, Apple, Email, and authorization-token Folo login methods; social login uses the official Folo page and one-time-token handoff.",
    "All browser business requests are same-origin relative /api requests; Go is the only Folo and Gemini egress owner.",
    "Gemini is fixed to provider google-gemini-openai, the official OpenAI-compatible endpoint, and model gemini-3.5-flash-lite.",
    "The Gemini API key is loaded only by Go from an operator-controlled secret file or local Keychain; no browser API accepts it and SQLite does not store it.",
    "Folo paid AI, membership, plan, power, wallet, payment, upgrade CTA and AI Chat are absent and denied by proxy policy; RSS subscription storage is preserved.",
    "Home uses a persisted seven-day unread daily queue with initial size 50 and same-day hard limit 60; pagination never reranks.",
    "Normal search navigates to /search without mutating Home; the AI icon opens an in-place filter sheet and commit changes Filter, Topics, and Queue atomically.",
    "OpenAPI, JSON Schema, SQLite migrations and Folo route policy require an approved spec amendment before implementation changes."
  ],
  "validationEntry": "bash spec-package/scripts/validate-package.sh",
